  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.personality.submissive": "Submissive",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.personality.submissive.desc": "When it's unhappy it balks at the lever, but push it again and it'll give in. It remembers that you did, though.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.personality.defensive": "Defensive",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.personality.defensive.desc": "If it's stressed or doesn't trust you, it simply won't fly. Keep it calm and earn its trust.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.personality.aggressive": "Aggressive",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.personality.aggressive.desc": "Keep forcing it when it doesn't want to go and it will fight back. It can and will hurt you.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.found": "Trait Discovered!",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.skittish": "Skittish",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.skittish.desc": "It gets stressed quickly, but calms down just as fast. It clings to anyone who soothes it.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.loyal": "Loyal",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.loyal.desc": "It learns to trust you quickly and doesn't lose faith in you easily. But it feels every hurt deeply, and a betrayal is almost impossible to mend.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.stubborn": "Stubborn",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.stubborn.desc": "It digs its heels in and says no sooner than most TARDISes. It's also much harder to break.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.forgiving": "Forgiving",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.forgiving.desc": "Fear and stress fade from it much faster than normal, though it feels things a little more deeply.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.grudge_holder": "Grudge-holder",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.grudge_holder.desc": "It doesn't forget, kindness or cruelty. Fear and stress fade slowly, but every kindness counts for more.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.protective": "Protective",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.protective.desc": "It braces itself to shield you, so crashes hit the people inside much softer. All that worrying does wear on it.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.possessive": "Possessive",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.possessive.desc": "It's devoted to its owner and really only listens to them. Anyone else will find it much harder to fly.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.welcoming": "Welcoming",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.welcoming.desc": "It's happy to fly for anyone, not just its owner. It's easily hurt, though.",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.disability.found": "Quirk Discovered!",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.disability.dyslexic": "Dyslexic",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.disability.dyslexic.desc": "It sometimes mixes up its coordinates, especially when stressed. It gets better with practice, but it never fully goes away.",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.mallet_fights_back": "The TARDIS lashes back at you!",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_controls_frozen": "The controls won't budge. The TARDIS doesn't trust you",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_control_sticks": "The control sticks... the TARDIS is wary of you",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_betrayed": "The TARDIS will never forget this betrayal",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.distrusting": "Distrusting",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.trait.distrusting.desc": "It doesn't trust you yet. Its controls will stick until you earn its trust, which comes slowly, but once earned it holds on to it and is hard to break. Don't abuse it.",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.mallet_seen_flinch": "The TARDIS flinches at the sight of the mallet",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.mallet_seen_braces": "The TARDIS braces itself and locks up tight",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.mallet_seen_threatens": "The TARDIS crackles threateningly. It remembers that mallet",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.disability.ptsd": "PTSD",
  "discovery.gallifreyan_chronicles.disability.ptsd.desc": "You hurt it too many times. It's always a little scared of you now, it gets stressed easily, and it'll flinch whenever it sees that mallet. Kindness can ease it, but it'll never fully forget.",
  "advancement.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_mind.ptsd.title": "What Have You Done?",
  "advancement.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_mind.ptsd.description": "Abuse your TARDIS until it develops PTSD",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_terrified": "The TARDIS is frozen in terror. The controls won't budge",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_terror_resists": "It's still frozen... it needs more convincing",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_terror_complies": "The TARDIS gives in, trembling",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_terror_savage": "The TARDIS fights for its life!",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_offering_accepted": "The TARDIS hums softly and accepts your offering",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_offering_again": "The TARDIS accepts it, though it's growing wise to bribes",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_offering_nervous": "The TARDIS takes it nervously, still flinching",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_offering_wait": "The TARDIS is still thinking about the last one",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_offering_content": "The TARDIS is fond of you already. It doesn't need bribing",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_offering_afraid": "The TARDIS is too frightened to accept anything from you",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_offering_betrayed": "The TARDIS turns away. Sweets can't mend this",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_uneasy": "The TARDIS hums uneasily as you step inside...",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_afraid": "The hum wavers and the lights stutter. The TARDIS is afraid of you",
  "message.gallifreyan_chronicles.tardis_dreads_you": "The TARDIS shudders. Its hum twists and the lights gutter in fear"
}
